00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:22.570
Sudah bersama

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:23.530
saya sejak kecil.

00:24:20.820 --> 00:24:23.480
Kamu sedang

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:23.940
sial kali ini.

00:24:21.860 --> 00:24:24.440
Sihir yang diajari Flamme, ya.

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:25.650
Suasana hatiku

00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:26.320
sedang buruk.

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.900
Kamu

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:25.900
sedang terluka.

00:24:25.570 --> 00:24:28.410
Ujian ketiga

00:24:26.280 --> 00:24:28.410
akan saya mulai.

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:27.660
Meremehkanku seperti biasa.

00:24:25.360 --> 00:24:28.410
Fern,

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:28.410
pulang saja, yuk.

